66
00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:23.740
What were we doing, Jenna, in April 2008 on the set of The Office?

67
00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:29.660
Because that is around the time when we filmed one of our guests today's most famous episodes.

68
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.420
